          "name:8": "The Disease",
          "autoclaim:1": 0,
          "issilent:1": 0,
          "snd_complete:8": "minecraft:entity.player.levelup",
          "globalshare:1": 0,
          "simultaneous:1": 0,
          "tasklogic:8": "AND",
          "desc:8": "What in the- this stuff is completely different to all life as we know it. Fungi and slime molds come close, but it also shares molecules with §osilicone rubber and lead paint§f of all things, aswell as some as of yet unidentified compounds.\nThere\u0027s no way something like this evolved here naturally, it feels out of place even in this biosphere.\n\nFrom what i could tell it also has no metabolism to speak of. As if it was lying dormant, waiting for new food to appear. Whatever that may be.\n\nIt will infect nearby living creatures however, presumably to defend itself in an energy-efficient \nmanner. "
        }
      },
