          "desc:8": "You know what they say: an engineer\u0027s job is not done whennothing more can be added, but when nothing more can be removed. Did not think i\u0027d ever have to design around removing... all of technology as we know it, \nbut nothing you and renowned mechanical Engineer §6Dr. Izawa§f can\u0027t solve if we put our\nheads together, right?",
