          "desc:8": "Hello there! I\u0027m §bQuinn Collins§f, Particle Physicist and Spatial Technician. Or at least that\u0027s what is on my diploma.\nSince I doubt that we\u0027ll be taking a closer look at warp drives or colliders anytime soon, I\u0027m basically sitting on my hands right now.\n\nMaybe my colleagues will find §5something§f they need my help explaining...",
